{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 606,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d22e2e9117a0642a215eadae",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，混音一下也许会挺有趣的。\\n……让我跳？哈，开什么玩笑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "753908323c1693d352f1694168db9dc9d8e6194a389588602b6edd625743aed8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "289"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:236b374df4e8c1234f3b486d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "放学后与Friends一起听了歌！\\n结果被乌拉拉抓住，于是福来、\\n米浴和我也跟着跳起了舞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ce91782568eddfab3444010137593f03de8de6c389aaebba40bbcf82650c86b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "29"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf6c3cc6f4ab63c8d3998693",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "看到帝皇和强志在游戏厅\\n玩这首歌……下次我也\\n想去试试看了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e2d277e940797dc13bc4c84b9a53051199fa9d9ddf8252ef76e35ab14e15868",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "290"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27bc603e29f97a1cc1854635",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊，之前会长用鼻音\\n哼唱的就是这首啊……\\n呵，这种曲子她也会听啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41de0e910a9b442415b6cee986ac5e280f1837f117e875b01b73b4249d4becb4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "291"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f404233743ed83ec6ecde919",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有点小伤感，但很好听的歌……\\n听着听着就觉得吃甜甜圈时\\n要一口一口细细品味才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a467a96e85e9e6c57d5b1687061e62684c4d8df44537619ba60a83c3170c1204",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "292"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dd8e2d5e43eb149e514d5f8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要不要试着把这首歌录成\\n「试着唱了一下」的视频上传呢♪……\\n那一定会成为永恒的回忆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02fc740229ae066fbd798fbfd19c6e3a8c0aca45fac71ab967434d097306de3e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "293"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4772b42188faf5063621cb39",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "之前和小成路一起\\n找到一等星的时候！\\n我们一边唱这首歌一边回家的～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "67004ed130b258c594c67b3f7770ace42d51976ddb1e36a8b17032632cfa9e71",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "294"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e025b4b0b3bb6533dfec08c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只要我不放弃，总有一天……也能成为星星……\\n不、不行！太自不量力了！\\n但……这首歌真的很能给人勇气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b70cc6a8b41c14acac722a0ce4f2bf1dbab3fcbf77db5e95b08a1edcd2dcd237",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "295"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0d018da4138387c07d6aad9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "难得有机会，\\n要不要用好音响来听听看？\\n我借你推荐的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae94b933b47dd867eabd7c2b214baaf49b87e92da4c1561a02552d8f9be37d2b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "296"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4497743ab983439e0d5d8384",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呼呼呼～♪\\n每首歌都很棒呢～。\\n真想在晒太阳的时候听呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "452ea70d4d29ee0e9bcc1d2ab4d0fbf4787e0db2892d4a46007aed5425371781",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "297"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a01b1d8733ba1a0a26b2898e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "“终点”是“银河的彼方”。\\n超越“第三宇宙速度”……\\n『一起守护』DPSE吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d33a23c72822230a0d2c0de4a1d4baa7ffb9a85f6ab5d484202c7047e887dfef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "298"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa5379e31b18646f544a633d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "＜方舟＞，还有＜奇点崩坏＞……\\n真是太有趣了！深邃的可能性，\\n就让我们一起揭开谜底吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7878575d4e27fd8326071b0b8e9defb06947eb8f9620f0230dc3ea93463f3311",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "299"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f279e136d5e21b7be57c05a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哇～这首歌曲也好棒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dcd841df4f4d50ca027b9f1f7c71e1aebaae8ea6bb556bd37973fc6c986d2e6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e2a7d159405013ea9252ed6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身体会自然而然地跟着节奏摆动！\\nHey！训练员！\\nShall we dance？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8354ff73e6958893a517b5a1dbe3b279f82033e5fd72c14fdc78300876439ba0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "30"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:874ee2156713c884f506f5d5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "宇宙旅行什么的也太豪华了吧！\\n说不定还能在银河正中央度假哟♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "06217c0775f8d76067478213b326dd1004fb0ed68a069500bc9eef65d30d927f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "300"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d3a297024d15d91c7a7cc83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在几千万光年外闪耀……\\n那无人知晓的星辰光辉。\\n我要用自己的双眼——",
      "source_fingerprint": "a652fcb8ef8dea0b44cc9c7d04d2b31dda76ce0baf98f61c28540cf56fd34f8e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97b36353c0112856056a9862",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每当听到这首歌就会有使命感。\\n安全锁已解除。任务\\n『拯救银河』……开始执行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "420b8644a2e9754ec5ca47caab1ec973fc669f9589f3b0f532c81fcffecdec54",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "302"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55f57379eeff3968d3b8f0f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "来吧，跳进音乐的泉水中！\\n摇滚、抒情、舞曲……\\n感受所有的声音吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14065ff5a1d1b4d7cc6a33e0dd792245b9a409feaccc7069591c328a4f3a03bc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "303"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58c1de934cdcf1d23d8113d5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我家的蔬菜本身就很美味。\\n如果用心去烹饪，\\n那绝对是顶级的美食！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c7281dcd23a61123ef9bcccb3b9adbadfd79090b98b61255886296ac5fea0a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "304"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ab3b446e056f22804f27fa1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『不吃饭者无樱饼』！\\n好吃的饭和和果子都要多吃，\\n为身体和心灵补充营养！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee60adbbed538b5a9ea216d07ec9d4af85bf2afe6f089a0ed5729c9a2b496db5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "305"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0eeaecb8a737d1793757b3c7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "做饭时最适合哼这首歌啦。\\n只要用心，无论歌曲还是饭菜\\n都会觉得『好吃』呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b113be359756210e2b856ea17f35ea575be17b186c5356bf04aecbee63eaa3c5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "306"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22a3364b5786be6ca4e519b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听到大家笑着说我开动啦，\\n就会想再做一次……\\n美食真的能让大家幸福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b31e02760dc9b701396a365f65e5caffff9152bdc36c6776adadb2a7fb3d6e8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "307"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b14c1c521715e916106408e0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "像花儿盛开般的歌，\\n又像风平浪静般温柔的旋律……\\n音乐也能激发设计灵感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f721b75d496cf21a1cc1fceaadd61de0e5541a260b9c0c859df8632a4523562",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "308"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:138584976e2500bf77dfb5e6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "来吧，放大声点！\\n给我来点帅气的吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41549883aa0ac9398995b5c9487665f403ad060042c63c0f384182d89961713d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "309"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe6fb743f7b84759fe51e3d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只有少数人才能抵达的遥远顶点……\\n呵呵，的确是条\\n值得走完全程的道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2d4a40b7a02af321d4db458d94a2da29b37649cb426bfda74855ef353e7180d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "31"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2696671f89514a493cd30421",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "动人旋律，触及心灵的歌词……\\n音乐真是实用且\\n美妙的文化啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "445b9aa85ff496ae72ee28ea5d60a84aae91285bac1b0192ef5624f83a26517c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "310"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b1ac773a99b2cb447ebbf1d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，需要BGM吗。\\n那就让我来打个节拍吧。呀，那就，\\n直线走起♪呀，那就，最高速♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5422af12a6a1468389c77cee2e3bc46f1cb8241cd88056de0a9cc3514bcda41",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a80b242034b46dfa9005ed7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "东奔西走，跨越大海……\\n谁知道下次会在哪里唱歌呢。\\n可别错过哦，训练师酱♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "53996bc1fe5aa5029801b955505e725c6d1482b7838d969ff5df13b00e7c78ed",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "312"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44fb623d4190e7c21122a187",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "未曾见过的世界……我所开辟的\\n道路尽头究竟有什么，我想走到尽头……\\n不，绝对要走到终点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a75a1d48b8b16698adf8de27ed5d66bf47d004f7a7a80d0bea6cc9ad68b79a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "313"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d622b881c739a51e59b5bcd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Con fuoco！热情如火！\\n与火焰的共舞，\\n没有比这更热烈的激情了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88515da7a9bafc972b92dd74ad0fcbbe3037514555c4f80c0222ed0fe2f3a69c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "314"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:412249fc03b653cc46810599",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "随着激烈舞蹈摇曳的战服——\\n一定是我最闪耀的舞台。\\n我要让它变成华丽的T台♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c6d250dc57cfd1065b16cff4d5cbd04addea74bb371e76f9c7d118512b51e83",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "315"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5c756366a6b34de05066506",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我要用比那巨大音响还大的嗓门\\n大吼一声，\\n『最强的就是我』！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "065ca6c6d0d36f2f301d7e62b3cfc85b6cf2d5b1dc94bfa6aadd9a73e864d409",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "316"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eb013275eb6819753f86497",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "目标就是这首歌的C位……\\n无论旅途如何，\\n我都会到达终点的——",
      "source_fingerprint": "eec488fbe5d41cf4b81b1f242dea5f61c67306cb052e5b329a8b98128e809a70",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "317"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c380db68c40bc611477af91",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "激光灯，好棒！真是太棒了！\\n我一定要站在那束直射的光芒\\n正中央，不，是一定会站上的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7afc560814561aeaf8b6c254b83c3513d67ad825835834cce14701c2108537a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "318"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdbf515bf66d564a4308ab64",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "强大、华丽、柔韧。\\n——只有完全掌握一切的人，\\n才有资格在这首歌里成为主角。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e70dab3a11c303de912e5dccde951339101ba7484daf683ff2920e9534a2d8a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "319"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0db725efcb15434139eb950b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然奔跑的理由各有不同，\\n但我想大家内心所望都是一样的……\\n一言以蔽之就是「想要获胜」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9968549c2b62143a001161cf92d1157a5171b214c936dded35237e63b1c0fb8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "32"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc37d840074141c7fa32ed06",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "LIVE舞台的弹出装置——\\n等候区的人超级紧张……\\n尤其是副歌部分更紧张……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e4cb46ba400552d506ddd91a43bca76f98c660c4ed0a4aa7da4ce3ce47e5852",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "320"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45c24950ce17272428d91451",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每次听这首歌就会想起……\\n刚知道学园里都是强者时，\\n那种由衷的兴奋感！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13c02c4292afe725d56133b87ad78126794bc75796be57a69f9a3ca8bc78612d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "321"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6aa0fc1a9e9a6e26fab11a0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『无数次不断奔跑』——\\n对许多赛马娘来说，\\n这就是希望之歌……我一直这么觉得。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03c3bcca11b9c9870e0c1c040ac2d6f0bb58ee29678aa3cb0df333915f9c5b77",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "322"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edeb31d7aab65fdad6a494dd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "和西沙里奥竞争时的喜悦，\\n追逐皇冠时的憧憬——\\n这首歌，说的就是我吗……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5afc9b967fb03e62d57f7026c3e089fdcba47342170ef20cd7a6ff12ad056c1d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "323"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab5ccb1d11d0ad91c64e174e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "上次去K歌看到勇心\\n边唱边跳，帅气极了！\\n我也想试试练习一下♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c1f10fc6957b357be5e62cbe35f76be7fde3b3ec19f79333884b43cd54067a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "324"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f91fae49237a9b14c7de5417",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『怪鸟传说，开幕de-su！』\\n我一个人唱的时候，\\n会唱成神鹰特别版哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3410b679e4ef71e72a1241c50878b407286db62e2873cf54139d64487d5e4ba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "325"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee8de01a3e1577bb4790e8e5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说起来以前……\\n我们俩一起在剩下的煎饼罐里——\\n……没什么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26c22c355ae4b2a81d65aa7f64a35164bfa0e83342f55e328918fae32b18c950",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "326"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c98194f0892fc38e5fbdbb0f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一起磨练心灵的好对手【伙伴】！\\n……感觉很有英雄味，很棒呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "36362086b619533a1fba925882434f6305df9ac84994b1a76d066bb8dd1ffbad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "327"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f9152c979ac2d177927c7e5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "玛雅很常听这首歌哦♪\\n不是都说『成熟女性不会回头看过去』嘛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "062eceb0d5cf97288e240104f187aca2d560259322a899e7d415b13ccead1e99",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "328"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a032e0a7446958ac5214851a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是这首啊，涡轮经常\\n在唱。不得不说\\n歌词还挺让人有感触的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "95fc0022a2d4aa3a799bdb20649a71d608e799eb1704f59bf4b183e862c623bb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "329"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8acb089d05be60dde6300c7a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请选择喜欢的歌曲并慢慢欣赏～\\n需要为你泡杯茶吗♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "897204309decab891912c3bc5092846ea46c12747d57cc69efefe2a1abd000bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "33"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e44be9fe0226bc35b86ffe8a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有能彼此照亮道路的伙伴……\\n真的很珍贵。\\n我也有类似的回忆呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f96d78065c03942488cf09b3ca12964da362578ae97b971f83474d7e2d76c38",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "330"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46272fe03d86801ee03e3b61",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唱着唱着肚子就咕咕叫了，\\n然后小春丽说\\n『一样呢～！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cb30d6bf0ba5c6535385497533c351f388060b74faab3aaeffcb911e5b45578",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "331"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce0ba2c68da946bf9a46af6a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在房间里唱歌时，善信\\n总会合着节拍喊『我要开动啦！』\\n气氛超棒的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "010199158fedc75e22e5a6e327fa5903623af3074394f7d39c0dbe6cf3a0ab9f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "332"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94d7b113a0755c56889dd7a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "青云同学『我都被小花的\\n哼唱洗脑了』，\\n……我唱了这么多次吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "313a14bb31c9bac375c71a26dc70a470b21c14fb519b09fc7f016244f0b5e611",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "333"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71375c88d34c98caf852ab6d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "偶尔会边听音乐边做料理☆\\n这首歌感觉做菜也会特别美味，\\n所以我超喜欢的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d50f500ea816db0740aff7690fdd355520810ce641f8f8557f864325e79a1c11",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "334"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42f0fc8fb25c8c1262dcb165",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想赢、想跑、想呐喊……\\n和那些家伙一起——！喂！\\n速子！茶座！快驹！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e428f7aea3f864c349ad0bef3bf6b4cfa1bc1adcc84592494487f7236c69fbc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "335"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:842507efea04c997245b5421",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『这就是本能』……正是如此，\\n我的求知欲也是一样——\\n所以，没办法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3b09971e750a8f4543a81be87d6dffe8b8bc35f378d372b6193f90d4b72dae7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "336"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddeafcaf7ecc9f57aacb6f0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "——嗯，是让人心跳加速的曲子呢。\\n——你也有同样的感觉吗……？\\n——呵呵，是吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "83f96403b11c9e37faab11072382159bfaffaf1ce560351cdbde2f2cdbb6b3fa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "337"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a486f031096a731cb10d93da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能否用你精心挑选的\\n音乐，为我的修炼\\n增添一抹色彩？",
      "source_fingerprint": "86cc214976ae40da56e70fedd3055e1449ffe6283938a406bf45378706588512",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "338"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca87b3fc1064f2a0f5d848b9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我很擅长一个人合唱哦。\\n看，用ON和OFF唱！\\n哈哈，要不要随便唱一首？",
      "source_fingerprint": "079efe08bb0b7293d9e90b366037c3bcde23ad9eecaf58a58d991baad5a200fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "339"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85ec3bdbb240af7b6bd03749",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在演唱会上也要持续燃烧斗志！\\n不论是最被看好还是大冷门，\\n都尽管来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "405f7dae39542055593cecc3ca1fb0bc4b0b3d85462ec8dd5a7cad376ac28bcb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "34"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de221ece7471f4a8c79f2fb8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说音乐能丰富心灵。\\n你现在需要的乐曲……\\n会是什么样的呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "19089a7a67c7410a5ddde82cabb8bfe1c5b036807225a6add6bb9a051b643b75",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "340"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d05790a89e463625817a7b72",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哦，好听的歌！\\n真想让青梅竹马们\\n也听一听。",
      "source_fingerprint": "883db1b6bb739c4b692e95e8e53659af583e6ebb203353917238222cb2ab605d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "341"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d783428572c9877b49cbd267",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可是啊可是啊……真是，\\n不肯放弃的歌词。\\n所以才会莫名一直在耳边回响吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "81ba4d0f2871ad7c20e5f59dc049a6a3b0d2670a55824dd38591dedf41617593",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "342"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bab3257279d7010dbefea0d7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "追寻无形之物……\\n哈哈，总觉得完全不像是在说别人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "564b6aac946210422e80007c9b13f37f1b5945f3902c2e51a05159c5d17dc18b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "343"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8d681baff224e297f8b6b9b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一直循环是因为在工作。\\n后半段那种节奏感……很棒……\\n说完了。走开，别打扰我工作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e1b352943acb59ea798ae46bbc7ba722e4ccd9d667993d1ae680168c54bbb9f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "344"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85c1da903e1df767b4b45d6a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要在无尽黑暗中前行，\\n即使违背天命，也需要“火焰”。\\n照亮未来的“希望之灯”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b37628fd41609b6438f147981da459cac205069c9d80c477f76b5014fbbda984",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "345"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44c4d738db0aaeaeb251b741",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "I’ll be alright——\\n——总有一天我也要——\\n自信地说出这句话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7a319517ec21648ef7edbdb4f46827adfe3062a3f0cd3c4854cb79b67718110",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "346"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d15c56230b1da81394b278c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每首歌都能让我充满活力。\\n用来当打扫时的BGM，\\n也许会让工作更高效哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23c7538ec11a1d27b72f326bb40a5301cbfb894057fd21c6832a5c2f44aea516",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "347"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb0c71b597a611afd657c598",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我其实更喜欢\\n古典风格的歌。\\n听了就有点想跳舞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a8aa9f8a9db988c56cbc822c62d0a40cb8f604c069fbc1c2b4aaf0e6ae39afb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "348"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cc88b943373b4ee97d31eb3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "全都是让人感动的旋律。\\n我们一边喝梨汁，\\n一边一起静心聆听吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbe22ee7ec882b98458dc78b065eb9c34c4f54259c8390c2723ff9511d2d2680",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "349"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:404166cf2b258d8eddad78c8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那家伙很强。\\n连自身的苦恼都克服了。真是的……\\n这样才值得我去打倒她嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b12dd95b2a5bb637fbc847ea4c9f32a4989444c66fab3acd5d78904c858b8a32",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "35"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dcde307c6afa6b530a743af",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "用音乐提升心情吧！\\n我要在你身边跳起来啦。……啊，\\n就算摔倒也会立刻爬起来哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf96dc74d4fc955a1458d4378310ed94765aaee3a78001b4b789ad775be382dd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "350"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e882f9c38dec7aeb191c1b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "把我喜欢的乐曲拿来。\\n你不说也\\n应该明白吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cec2ed966ceb23754b86b8c7ea22d7922832ef1a6c02c5358f4fa04cb093420a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "351"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e20c7ea0dc42da7d7e11c76",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "龙卷风~~~♪一起转起来～\\nFes上燥起来根本停不下来☆\\n太夏天啦～♪Put your hands up！",
      "source_fingerprint": "827c4cc336570ec67dbe8ed36462c1d986c35413d61e5b545263e094021c9e64",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "352"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:109819b3272d2c35a3816490",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每次听这首歌，沙子的触感、\\n贴在皮肤上的衬衫感觉……\\n都会让我想起最棒的夏天！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf5adcbce5be72eac19d1b111bf0ddd6f81e9cc112ad09bd589fe25bf8ff6a71",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "353"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f09e8f2233f33c66c40e9fe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无论做什么，节奏都很重要……\\n这首歌恰好完美。\\n跟着节拍做仰卧起坐！很有用哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "282f16211272aa7fede67553e76695b9fbcc951aa8dcf2cfbf68cd34f420ef94",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "354"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:037f8f6a5b59d6908be8ca07",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "音乐节这种事，没契机很难去吧？\\n那……要不要让我来\\n给你创造个机会？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e6f526cc46413fc7d591ee6dd18dc91ea0d92c6ba73cea81430821c6e6cb21c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "355"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae1b45d2a4cf612f59143342",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "画面上快速闪现出来的\\n是小真。大家一起找找看，\\n她出现在了哪里呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d569647ce5013717c773758cb0d3f7646a4e29839de973da1747c8c31a0ca536",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "356"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7a46cd818c8de8a4e0fe70b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真的，团队赛太累人了！\\n你可得好好感谢我\\n参加了比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8295dcd6ee37570fdf94dde3b8bf0562d96e9b554016897aed763342f25906de",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "357"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37d1e4449824fbc055a3a02c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "承载着我们的灵魂……\\n跨越狂涛猛进吧！\\nSHAKEROCK！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93bba51bbd4747ff6b4eb947e2e010727cc6900d5aaac0e9aa22f4222165563d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "358"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be57751980b7a4fb50c0b13a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听着听着突然好想吃寿司！\\n出发吧，寿司！\\n玛雅要三文鱼蛋黄酱♪你呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef66672fe5d971222cd930ba4b0ec7e14562f42cb4083d6151a7524e0652775d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "359"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c769b9d12fe7a8335c20b33",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练公！一起唱歌吧！\\n可不准你拒绝啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c3d4cb59de5437f21e31e6aa0c96575b1d6075c8141c108cf509bd5da68189c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "36"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
